  "scope": "The prior tests spec section 6 lists for L4b (approved by the owner on 2026-10-29): the importers of credential_name_for (import line only; 30 files import tests.credential_names, 26 change only that line), test_neutral_credential_vocabulary.py, test_profile_conflict_arms_retired.py (the mutate call scan re-expressed as test_the_blob_store_has_no_mutation_path, the two conflict-class tests retired with a tombstone), test_provider_access_import_boundary.py, and every section 4.4 test-debt file: T-F1, T-F2 (tests/conftest.py: only the probe's dead mutate is removed, the probe stays; spec section 4.4 amended on 2026-11-02 to match), T-F3 (openai route_harness and the three openrouter _post_chat helpers), T-F5 (test_pair_admin_disposition.py: a class-level read spy with a positive control), T-F8/K6 (tests/unit/conftest.py), T-F9, T-F10, T-F11, T-F12 (including the openai suite comment in test_openai_keyed_max_tokens.py::test_equal_effective_ceilings_share_one_entry), T-F13 (test_profile_index_offline_only.py, with a tombstone for test_only_the_neutral_credential_name_remains), K4 (the seeded rows' statuses are pinned, then each forbidden value is found in storage before its absence from the body is asserted) and critic-3. In test_provider_access_availability_route.py, \"mutate\" also leaves the method tuple of test_route_reads_no_secret_builds_no_strategy_and_writes_nothing, forced by the removal of ORMStore.mutate. Plus three files outside the section 6 list, approved by the owner on 2026-10-30: test_credential_blob_store.py (the two mutate tests deleted, tombstone), test_credential_blob_operational_outcomes.py (test_credential_mutation_resets_the_operational_register deleted, tombstone) and test_availability_follows_resolve.py (mutate dropped from the forbidden-method tuple). No other assertion, input or expected value changes. Re-pinned on 2026-11-02 with the owner's approval after review: the credential-name comments in test_profile_index_offline_only.py and test_neutral_credential_vocabulary.py corrected, and the K4 status pin added. Extended on 2026-11-02 with the owner's approval after a further review, so every prior test file the branch changes is pinned byte-exact (51): the 26 files whose only change is the credential_name_for import line, and the docstring or comment edits of T-F1 (test_provider_credential_admin.py), T-F11 (live/test_anthropic_live.py, live/test_gemini_live.py) and T-F12 (integration/test_provider_access_backing_postgres.py, which also changes its import line, test_openai_route_global_cache.py, test_openai_route_global_cache_modifier.py). In the same round the blob-store surface check reads the public names the MRO exposes (dir, not vars), with a positive control for an inherited member, and the credential-name scan in test_profile_index_offline_only.py covers every binding (def, class, assignment target, import alias), with a positive control per form.",
